   <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-ads\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/arXiv:1804.07389\">NASA ADS</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-google-scholar\" href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?arxiv_id=1804.07389\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google Scholar</a></li>\n      <li><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-small cite-semantic-scholar\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/arXiv:1804.07389\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Semantic Scholar</a></li>\n     </ul>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-general\">\n     <div class=\"what-is-this\">\n      <h3><a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small trackback-link\" href=\"https://arxiv.org/tb/1804.07389\"> 1 blog link</a></h3>\n      (<a href=\"https://info.arxiv.org/help/trackback.html\" class=\"trackback-help\">what is this?</a>)\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"extra-ref-cite\">\n     <button type=\"button\" id=\"bib-cite-trigger\" class=\"bib-cite-button abs-button\">export BibTeX citation</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bookmarks\">\n     <div>\n      <h3>Bookmark</h3>\n     </div>\n     <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"http://www.bibsonomy.org/BibtexHandler?requTask=upload&amp;url=https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.07389&amp;description=Longest Straight Line Paths on Water or Land on the Earth\" title=\"Bookmark on BibSonomy\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/bibsonomy.png\" alt=\"BibSonomy\"> </a> <a class=\"abs-button abs-button-grey abs-button-small\" href=\"https://reddit.com/submit?url=https://arxiv.org/abs/1804.07389&amp;title=Longest Straight Line Paths on Water or Land on the Earth\" title=\"Bookmark on Reddit\"> <img src=\"https://arxiv.org/static/browse/0.3.4/images/icons/social/reddit.png\" alt=\"Reddit\"> </a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <!--end extra-services-->\n   <!-- LABS AREA -->\n   <div id=\"labstabs\"></div>\n   <!-- END LABS AREA -->\n   <div class=\"endorsers\">\n    <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/auth/show-endorsers/1804.07389\" class=\"endorser-who\" rel=\"nofollow\">Which authors of this paper are endorsers?</a> | Disable MathJax (<a href=\"https://info.arxiv.org/help/mathjax.html\">What is MathJax?</a>) <span class=\"help\" style=\"font-style: normal; float: right; margin-top: 0; margin-right: 1em;\"></span>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Rohan Chabukswar 和 Kushal Mukherjee 提出了一种数学方法，使用分支定界算法来确定地球上最长的直线水路或陆路路径。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Rohan Chabukswar 和 Kushal Mukherjee 提出了一种数学方法，使用分支定界算法来确定地球上最长的直线水路或陆路路径。",
  "summary": "这篇 arXiv 论文摘要概述了寻找最长直线距离（不触碰陆地）的数学公式和优化方法，以及相反问题（不触碰水）。由于海岸线是分形的，并且岛屿和湖泊的分布具有混沌性，作者将这些问题建模为复杂的优化问题，并使用分支定界算法进行求解。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "将地球极端直线路径问题表述为优化挑战。",
      "explanation": "论文旨在确定完全在水上或完全在陆上可行驶的绝对最长直线距离。"
    },
    {
      "point": "克服由地理不规则性引起的计算复杂性。",
      "explanation": "岛屿、湖泊的存在以及海岸线的分形性质，使得优化问题具有混沌性，计算难度很大。"
    },
    {
      "point": "应用分支定界算法。",
      "explanation": "作者开发了一种特定方法，使用分支定界算法来有效地计算和验证这些极端路径。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "{\"quote\":\"从本质上讲，这是一个优化问题，由于岛屿、湖泊的存在以及海岸线的分形性质，而变得具有混沌性。\"，\"attribution\":\"Rohan Chabukswar， Kushal Mukherjee\"}"
  ],
